  "details": "I really like using the Enchanted Broom because it lets me fly around VRChat. Flying around with the broomstick is really fun, and I enjoy using it to explore worlds and move around.\n\nI know the Enchanted Broom is a limited-time Halloween item and isn’t currently in the Item Shop. I would really like VRChat to bring it back to the Item Shop so people can purchase it and use it again.\n\nEven if it only returns during future Halloween events, I would love to have the opportunity to buy the Enchanted Broom and keep using its flying ability.\n\nThank you for considering my suggestion!",
